# A module of defect 2143's cases (lane lane-witnessed-seed, 2026-10-19): a
# name the header lacks, told in the build that tells the root's own refusal
# since defect 2143's other half (2026-10-25, M-rechecked-issues), and a
# value only the probe sees.

extern "fixedbugs-2128-values.h"
    constant K_NONE: i64  #~ ffi_unknown_name
    constant K_DIV: i64  #~ ffi_constant_type

function got() -> i64
    return K_NONE + K_DIV
